                <pb facs="0965" n="829" sameAs="frus:frus1929v01/pg829"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/334a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Kaufman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-01-02T16:00:00-05:00">January 2, 1929—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>2. Department’s January 2, 11 a.m. Conference will hold a plenary session on
                        Friday<anchor n="11" xml:id="d682-f1"/> morning at eleven o’clock and it is
                    hoped that protocol may be signed before that time. The Conference will probably
                    adjourn on Saturday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
